  "A1": [
   "s",
   "Following TR108 results being published, we identified that some tenders were incorrectly accepted and rejected. The tenders affected were 108.155, 108.156,108.161, 108.162, 108.163 and 108.165 associated with the Kiwi Power tenders were due to a manual error. We can confirm that no other providers are affected. \n\nTender line 108.145 associated with Hall Farm has been amended to rejected as the tender is mutually exclusive with accepted tender 108.144.\n\nPlease see the tender round results republication below for details.\n"
  ],
